                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3228: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-04T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 4,
                                1921—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>54. You will refrain from pressing for allocation of customs surplus as proposed
                    in your telegram 75, February 3, 1 p.m. Further instructions follow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
